ine;color:rgb(119,119,119);\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"entry-date\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">2014/02/24</span></a> <span class=\"meta-sep\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">by</span> <span class=\"author vcard\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"http://www.radia.fm/?author=16\" title=\"View all posts by radio papesse\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(119,119,119);\" rel=\"nofollow\">radio papesse</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-content\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:12px 0px 0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\"><p style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">This week show is a special <em style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">cutandslice</em> produced by <strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">WJM</strong> for <a href=\"http://www.radiopapesse.org/\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\">Radio Papesse</a> coming as series of outtakes form her album <a href=\"http://imorsi.bandcamp.com/album/no\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\">NO</a></p><p style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\"><a href=\"http://www.radia.fm/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/wjm.jpg\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"//web.archive.org/web/2im_/http://www.radia.fm/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/wjm.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"wjm\" width=\"404\" height=\"482\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-2940\" style=\"background:transparent;border:none;margin:4px 0px 12px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;float:right;height:auto;\" /></a></p><p style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\"><strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">Roberta WJM Andreucci</strong> is a percussionist, an experimental producer and DJ, and on air personality. She has more than twenty year of experience organizing and promoting alternative music events. She practices plagiarism and the cutting and mixing of musical and ambiental aural sources. Early in her career she started focusing on the use of voices and on vocal metalinguism, focalizing on her personal practice of “cuttingandslicing” and on rhythm patterns obtained through an improper use of her tools of the trade (cdjs, cd<br />player, md, mics, mixer).<br />Through the years her percussion set morphed into a hybrid encompassing a dj booth, a radio dj one, a microphone station for electroacustic experiments, and a mnemonic butcher’s slab.<br />She is a founding member of performing music units such as <a href=\"http://jealousyparty.bandcamp.com/\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jealousy Party</a>, Semerssuaq, <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/thesecretaries\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Secretaries</a> and Sistemi Audiofobici Burp.<br />She is the director of the music label <a href=\"http://www.radia.fm/www.burpenterprise.com\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\">Burp Publications</a>.</p><p style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\"></p><p style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\"><a href=\"http://vimeo.com/73420345\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\">Q05 ::: ROBERTA WJM ::: 12.07.2013 ::: BERLIN</a></p><div><br /></div></div>","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","radiaseason":"32","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Radio Papesse","title":"Show 0465: WJM cuts by Roberta WJM Andreucci (Radio Papesse)","publicdate":"2016-11-26 14:22:51","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2016-11-26 14:22:51","backup_location":"ia906301_28"},"server":"ia803207.us.archive.org","uniq":36675469,"workable_servers":["ia803207.us.archive.org","ia903207.us.archive.org"]}